            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## 1.0.36

- Fixed the Claude CLI agent profile for the standard Claude Code installation: it now discovers the newest installed native Claude Code version on every launch instead of relying on a Homebrew path.
- Migrated the previous Homebrew-only built-in Claude CLI command to a portable `claude -p` profile.

]]></description>
